  "description": "<p>A sleek, must-have ring designed for law enforcement officers. This Thin blue line band is crafted with tungsten carbide, allowing the police memento to hold it shape long term, while the Thin Blue Line boldly highlights the middle of this police wedding ring. Additionally, the edges of this police ring are beveled at 45 degrees adding dimension and craftsmanship. Rothco&rsquo;s law enforcement band measures 2.5MM in thickness, and 8MM in width, with a 1MM thin blue line. Our blue line band also makes for a thoughtful birthday or retirement gift for police officers. Proceeds From This Purchase Benefit Families Of Fallen First Responders.</p>",
